---
// MasterLineage.astro - Luxury Editorial Lineage & Observatory Heritage
---

<section id="lineage" class="py-32 relative border-t border-hairline">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 relative z-10">
    
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-16 items-center">
      
      <!-- Left Column: Fine Astronomical & Vedic Geometric Diagram -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-5 relative">
        <div class="relative w-full aspect-square border border-hairline bg-[#080A12]/60 p-8 flex flex-col justify-between">
          
          <!-- Fine Astronomical Radial Linework -->
          <div class="absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center pointer-events-none opacity-25">
            <div class="w-72 h-72 rounded-full border border-[#F2EEE7]/30"></div>
            <div class="absolute w-52 h-52 rounded-full border border-dashed border-[#C8A45C]/40"></div>
            <div class="absolute w-36 h-36 rounded-full border border-[#F2EEE7]/20"></div>
            <div class="absolute w-full h-[1px] bg-[#F2EEE7]/10"></div>
            <div class="absolute h-full w-[1px] bg-[#F2EEE7]/10"></div>
          </div>

          <!-- Top Metadata Label -->
          <div class="relative z-10 flex justify-between items-center text-[9px] font-mono tracking-[0.25em] text-[#9696A5]">
            <span>FOUNDATIONAL LINEAGE</span>
            <span>EST. 1998</span>
          </div>

          <!-- Center Emblem Typography -->
          <div class="relative z-10 text-center my-auto py-10 space-y-2">
            <div class="text-[10px] font-mono tracking-[0.35em] text-[#C8A45C] uppercase">
              MASTER PRACTITIONER
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-editorial text-3xl sm:text-4xl text-[#F2EEE7] font-normal tracking-wide">
              Pandith Vikram Ji
            </h3>
            <p class="text-[11px] font-sans tracking-[0.2em] text-[#9696A5] uppercase">
              Indian Astrologer & Vedic Clairvoyant
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- Bottom Coordinates -->
          <div class="relative z-10 pt-4 border-t border-hairline flex justify-between text-[9px] font-mono text-[#9696A5]/70">
            <span>SURYA SIDDHANTA</span>
            <span>BHRIGU SAMHITA</span>
            <span>PARASHARA HORA</span>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right Column: Luxury Editorial Narrative & Ethics -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-7 space-y-8">
        
        <div class="space-y-3">
          <div class="text-[10px] tracking-[0.35em] text-[#C8A45C] uppercase font-mono">
            VEDIC HERITAGE &bull; THE RIGVEDIC CODEX
          </div>
          <h2 class="font-editorial text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl text-[#F2EEE7] font-normal leading-[1.08]">
            Three Generations of Celestial Mathematical Mastery
          </h2>
        </div>

        <p class="font-sans text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#9696A5] font-light leading-relaxed">
          Astrology in its authentic Vedic incarnation is not dogmatic superstition. It is the celestial chronometry of human consciousness. Born into a distinguished familial lineage of Himalayan scholars and Vedic astrologers, <strong class="text-[#F2EEE7] font-medium">Pandith Vikram Ji</strong> synthesizes the mathematical horary principles of the <em class="text-[#F2EEE7] font-editorial text-base">Brihat Parashara Hora Shastra</em> with deep psychological empathy.
        </p>

        <p class="font-sans text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#9696A5] font-light leading-relaxed">
          From his sanctuary located at <strong class="text-[#F2EEE7] font-medium">7001 Hollywood Blvd, Los Angeles, CA 90028</strong>, Pandith Vikram serves as a trusted refuge for individuals, families, entrepreneurs, and seekers across California, the United States, and worldwide.
        </p>

        <!-- Three Architectural Pillars of the Sanctuary -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-6 pt-4 border-t border-hairline">
          <div class="space-y-2">
            <span class="text-[9px] font-mono tracking-[0.25em] text-[#C8A45C] uppercase block">
              CANON I
            </span>
            <div class="font-editorial text-lg text-[#F2EEE7]">Strict Confidentiality</div>
            <p class="text-[11px] font-sans text-[#9696A5] font-light leading-relaxed">
              Every birth chart, consultation recording, and personal history is protected under absolute non-disclosure.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="space-y-2">
            <span class="text-[9px] font-mono tracking-[0.25em] text-[#C8A45C] uppercase block">
              CANON II
            </span>
            <div class="font-editorial text-lg text-[#F2EEE7]">Non-Judgmental Refuge</div>
            <p class="text-[11px] font-sans text-[#9696A5] font-light leading-relaxed">
              A serene sanctuary to voice life's deepest wounds—free from moralizing dogma or sensationalism.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="space-y-2">
            <span class="text-[9px] font-mono tracking-[0.25em] text-[#C8A45C] uppercase block">
              CANON III
            </span>
            <div class="font-editorial text-lg text-[#F2EEE7]">Verifiable Remedies</div>
            <p class="text-[11px] font-sans text-[#9696A5] font-light leading-relaxed">
              Only authentic Rigvedic mantras, geometrically precise Siddh Yantras, and certified untreated gemstones.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>
